When making online purchases, opt for secure payment methods that offer additional protection. Credit cards often provide better fraud protection than debit cards, and some offer virtual card numbers that can be used for online transactions. Consider using payment services like PayPal or Apple Pay, which add an extra layer of security by keeping your financial details private from the merchants. Always ensure the payment platform you choose is reputable and widely accepted.

